name: "mindustry-survivors"
displayName: "Mindustry Survivors"
author: "Zerkka"
main: "mindustrysurvivors.MindustrySurvivorsMod"
subtitle: "Vampire Survivors in Mindustry"
description: "[accent]Mindustry Survivors[]\n[lightgray]Vampire Survivors in Mindustry[]\n\n\n[#ff9a3c]How to play[]\n\nSurvive [accent]50 waves[] on a random map while enemies chase you from every side.\n\nKill them to pick up [#84f491]gems[] and level up. Each level offers 3 choices:\n[accent]>[] a new [accent]turret[]\n[accent]>[] an [accent]upgrade[] for a turret you have\n[accent]>[] a [#5c9cff]passive[] that makes you faster or tougher\n\nThere is nothing to build. Just move, aim and stay alive.\n\n\n[#ff9a3c]What waits for you[]\n\n[accent]>[] All [accent]28 turrets[] from Serpulo and Erekir, each with 10 levels\n[accent]>[] [scarlet]Bosses[] every 25 waves\n[accent]>[] [#b07ae8]Curses[] past Eradication for a real challenge [lightgray](experimental, not balanced yet)[]\n[accent]>[] [accent]Endless[] mode after wave 50\n\n\n[lightgray]Needs Mindustry v8 (build 160 or newer). Desktop only.[]"
version: "0.1.0"
minGameVersion: "160"
java: true
